{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"santizhu-e-o130a","title":"范慎受任太尉","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu-a-7614a7fbdd7a765f1764","label":"正文","text":"范慎受任太尉","evidence":["santizhu-q-f190207510cc8d6c3c54"]},{"id":"santizhu059-a-aad30975d7a715dc1a04","label":"裴注·吴录","text":"《吴录》载孙皓诏曰：“慎，勋德俱茂，朕所敬凭；宜登上公，以副众望。”以为太尉","evidence":["santizhu059-q-ec321812f4c62a2cfae4"]}],"participants":[{"person":"santizhu-p0086","role":"受任太尉","evidence":["santizhu-q-f190207510cc8d6c3c54"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["santizhu-q-f190207510cc8d6c3c54"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu-q-f190207510cc8d6c3c54","source_order":[48,95,68],"order":8771},{"id":"santizhu-e-o100a","title":"范慎卒","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu-a-66baace9fe3152bc4cb6","label":"正文","text":"范慎卒","evidence":["santizhu-q-9ece8e5209ec0f01504a"]}],"participants":[{"person":"santizhu-p0086","role":"卒","evidence":["santizhu-q-9ece8e5209ec0f01504a"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["santizhu-q-9ece8e5209ec0f01504a"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu-q-9ece8e5209ec0f01504a","source_order":[48,100,0],"order":8804},{"id":"santizhu064-e-sr-horse-ear","title":"《恪别传》恪献马残耳答范慎、答太子马矢之嘲","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu064-a-dfa94f5fef716a7bbeab","label":"裴注·恪别传","text":"恪献权马先其耳；范慎嘲残耳伤仁，恪答穿耳附珠何伤于仁；太子嘲恪可食马矢，恪愿太子食鸡卵，权问故，恪答所出同耳，权大笑","evidence":["santizhu064-q-bccd29c3135464678052"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0041","role":"献马并答范慎、太子之嘲","evidence":["santizhu064-q-bccd29c3135464678052"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"受献马并问、大笑","evidence":["santizhu064-q-bccd29c3135464678052"]},{"person":"santizhu-p0086","role":"嘲恪残马耳","evidence":["santizhu064-q-bccd29c3135464678052"]},{"person":"zhouyu-p0025","role":"嘲恪食马矢（太子）","evidence":["santizhu064-q-bccd29c3135464678052"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu064-q-bccd29c3135464678052"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu064-q-bccd29c3135464678052","source_order":[64,28,0],"order":10929}],"persons":[{"id":"santizhu-p0086","name":"范慎","evidence":["santizhu-q-9ece8e5209ec0f01504a","santizhu-q-f190207510cc8d6c3c54","santizhu059-q-ec321812f4c62a2cfae4","zhanggu-q-d7c6bfee867816b7caf2"],"facts":[{"id":"santizhu059-f-sr-077","text":"《吴录》称慎著论二十篇名《矫非》，后为侍中，出补武昌左部督治军整顿；孙皓移都惮之，诏以为太尉；慎托老耄，凤凰三年卒，子耀嗣","evidence":["santizhu059-q-ec321812f4c62a2cfae4"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"zhanggu-m-9f12e77e51c90d465d8c","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及范慎","evidence":["zhanggu-q-d7c6bfee867816b7caf2"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu-q-9ece8e5209ec0f01504a","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-84945824f1340aaca16b","layer":"original","quote":"是岁，太尉范慎卒","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":429,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":8},{"id":"santizhu-q-f190207510cc8d6c3c54","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-8218bfa6bf0ccc90e22e","layer":"original","quote":"以武昌督范慎为太尉〖16〗","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":401,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":68,"end":81},{"id":"santizhu059-q-ec321812f4c62a2cfae4","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-0b7d8c39eaea0ad6ff01","layer":"pei","quote":"慎，字孝敬，广陵人。竭忠知己之君，缠绵三益之友：时人荣之。著论二十篇，名曰《矫非》。后为侍中。出补武昌左部督，治军整顿。孙皓移都，甚惮之，诏曰：‘慎，勋德俱茂，朕所敬凭；宜登上公，以副众望。’以为太尉。慎自恨久为将，遂托老耄。军士恋之，举营为之陨涕。凤凰三年卒。子耀嗣。","attribution":"裴注·吴录","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":25,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-907884c580254ae9cf88","start":10,"end":145},{"id":"santizhu064-q-bccd29c3135464678052","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-e8c408211dc6ad158d52","layer":"pei","quote":"恪尝献权马，先 其耳。范慎时在坐，嘲恪曰：‘马虽（大）〔六〕畜，禀气于天；今残其耳，岂不伤仁？’恪答曰：‘母之于女，恩爱至矣；穿耳附珠，何伤于仁？’太子尝嘲恪：‘诸葛元逊可食马矢。’恪曰：‘愿太子食鸡卵。’权曰：‘人令卿食马矢，卿使人食鸡卵：何也？’恪曰：‘所出同耳。’权大笑。”","attribution":"裴注·恪别传","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":27,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-12b3579a9c9a4da79693","start":219,"end":359},{"id":"zhanggu-q-d7c6bfee867816b7caf2","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-e7c668f34b2cb03e8c27","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞陆机为谭传曰：“宣太子正位东宫，天子方隆训导之义；妙简俊彦，讲学左右。时四方之杰毕集，太傅诸葛恪等，雄奇盖众；而谭以清识绝伦，独见推重。自太尉范慎、谢景、（羊徽）〔羊衟〕之徒，皆以秀称；其名而悉在谭下。”","attribution":"裴注·陆机《顾谭传》","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":232,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-6e97af01b0f6928da4e6","start":0,"end":105}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
